flowchart TD
    Browser[Browser] --> APIGW[API Gateway]
    APIGW --> Lambda[Lambda handlers]
    Lambda --> DDB[DynamoDB transaction]
    DDB --> Stream[DynamoDB Streams]
    Stream --> Relay[Outbox relay]
    Relay --> SQS[SQS with partial batch response]
    SQS --> Function[Idempotent analytics Lambda]
    Function --> Aggregate[Aggregate and job status]
    Lambda -. OTLP or layer .-> Gateway[Collector gateway]
    Function -. OTLP or layer .-> Gateway
    Lambda -. JSON stdout .-> CW[CloudWatch Logs]
    CW -. forwarding .-> Loki[Loki]
    Gateway --> Tempo[Tempo]
    Gateway --> Mimir[Metrics backend]
    Tempo --> Grafana[Grafana]
    Mimir --> Grafana
    Loki --> Grafana
